<section class="content-card"><div class="content-heading"><div><span class="content-eyebrow">WHOLE WEBSITE</span><h2>Site themes</h2></div><span>Shared appearance · pages · navigation · store · journal</span></div>
<p>Install matching HTML pages as one website theme. Pages arrive as drafts; activate the shared header and footer after reviewing them. Existing pages and menu entries stay in place.</p>
<% @site_themes.each do |template| %><% theme=template.settings.fetch("lightek_site_theme") %><article class="content-theme"><h3><%= template.name %> <%= "· Active" if @site.active_template_id==template.id %></h3><ul><% theme.fetch("pages").each do |page| %><li><%= page["filename"] %> → <%= page["slug"] %> · <%= page["role"] %><% page.fetch("warnings",[]).each do |warning| %><small><%= warning %></small><% end %></li><% end %></ul><%= link_to "Review Pages & Sections",dymond_dash.pages_path(site_id:@site.id),class:"content-button" %><% unless @site.active_template_id==template.id %><%= button_to "Activate website theme",activate_dashboard_website_theme_path(template_id:template.id,site_id:@site.id),class:"content-button primary" %><% end %></article><% end %>
<details><summary>Build a website theme from your design library</summary><% designs=LightekDesign::Catalog.selectable_designs(user:current_user,active:LightekDesign::Catalog.design_for(@site)); options=designs.map{|key,design|[design["name"],key]} %><%= form_with url:dashboard_website_themes_path(site_id:@site.id),local:true,class:"content-form" do %><%= hidden_field_tag :request_key,SecureRandom.uuid %><label>Theme name<%= text_field_tag :name,nil,required:true,maxlength:120,placeholder:"My complete business website" %></label><label>Home design<%= select_tag :home_design,options_for_select(options,LightekDesign::Catalog.design_for(@site)),include_blank:"Choose an installed design",required:true %></label><label>Additional page designs (optional)<%= select_tag :page_designs,options_for_select(options),multiple:true,size:5 %></label><p>Select up to seven additional designs. Existing imported pages keep their edits and publication settings.</p><label class="content-check"><%= check_box_tag :include_store,"1",true %> Include a live store with products, cart and checkout</label><label class="content-check"><%= check_box_tag :include_blog,"1",true %> Include a journal with your published articles</label><p>The store and journal use live application sections and the theme's shared appearance. Demo products and sample posts are not imported as business records.</p><%= submit_tag "Build draft website theme",class:"content-button primary" %><% end %></details>
<details><summary>Install a website theme from HTML</summary><%= form_with url:dashboard_website_themes_path(site_id:@site.id),multipart:true,local:true,class:"content-form" do %>
<%= hidden_field_tag :request_key,SecureRandom.uuid %><label>Theme name<%= text_field_tag :name,nil,required:true,maxlength:120,placeholder:"My business website" %></label>
<label>Matching HTML pages<%= file_field_tag "theme_files[]",multiple:true,data:{theme_files:true},accept:".html,.htm,text/html",required:true %></label><p>Choose up to 10 pages. index.html or home.html becomes the home layout; otherwise the first file does. Files named store/shop and blog/journal connect to the live store and journal.</p>
<label>Home page<%= select_tag :home_file,options_for_select([["Detect index/home, then first file",""]]),data:{theme_home:true} %></label>
<label>Shared CSS (optional)<%= file_field_tag :css_file,accept:".css,text/css" %></label><details><summary>Import options</summary><label>Store product container (optional)<%= text_field_tag :product_selector,nil,placeholder:"[data-lightek-products] or #grid" %></label><p>Blog layouts need a main element. JavaScript is removed; application sections supply live posts and products. Other script-generated areas require rebuilding with native sections. HTML/CSS: 500 KB each.</p></details><%= submit_tag "Install draft website theme",class:"content-button primary",data:{turbo_submits_with:"Installing theme…"} %><% end %></details></section>
